   :thumbnail-image <https://img.turkiyetoday.com/images/2025/11/28/8500-year-old-carved-faces-and-tiny-double-faced-bead-reshape-sefertepes-role-in-tas-3210504.jpeg> .

:head-base-pillar-sayburc a :human-figure ;
