   :material-note "Ink and white pigment on silk" ;
   :note "Translated from Chinese Wikipedia: “In the lower part of the painting is a woman standing in profile, her hands pressed together in an attitude of prayer. She faces to the left, her long hair coiled into a hanging bun; she wears a long, wide-sleeved robe with cloud patterns, slender at the waist and bound with a broad white sash, and a long skirt that trails the ground, its hem turned upward.”" ;
