   :material-note "Tempura on beach wood" ;
   :note "From Wikipedia: “The painting has the dimensions of 115 x 86.9 cm. The frame, decorated with the same printed decoration as the background of the painting, is original. The painting was restored in 1968 (R. Slánský) and in the 1980s (K. Veselý). Saint Catherine is holding the usual attributes - in her left hand a torture wheel with metal spikes, in her right hand a sword with which, according to legend, she was beheaded.”" ;
